Run component extension conformance fixtures

Usage:
  eshu component conform <manifest> [flags]

Flags:
      --component-home string   Component registry home directory
      --fixture strings         Collector SDK result fixture JSON file; repeat for multiple fixtures
  -h, --help                    help for conform
      --json                    Write stable JSON output
      --mode string             Conformance mode: fixture or compose (default "fixture")

Global Flags:
      --database string   Temporarily override database backend
  -V, --visual            Show results as interactive graph visualization
